      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>In the name [of the Compassionate]</li>\n<li><i>&ldquo;Behold God is my salvation,&rdquo; etc.</i></li>\n<li>The cantor Faraj Allah, <i>(may the) R(ock) p(rotect you)</i>, shall take note [that] the</li>\n<li>bearer of this is the <i>orphan boy</i> Musa. Ask</li>\n<li>the e(lder) Yi\u1e63\u1e25aq [about him]. If they refuse to give [him she]lter,</li>\n<li>please send a messenger and let me know immediately, so that [I can do]</li>\n<li>what is necessary to them. Beware of [being disobedient].</li>\n<li>And may God, the ex(alted), be your succor.</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
